  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The Gu Yue academy elder places middle stage as the second of four small realms inside each of the nine ranks, after initial stage and before upper stage and peak stage.",
      "chapters": [
        7
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_gu_yue_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later states the same cut: from initial stage to middle stage, and from middle stage to upper stage, are small realms, while rank one peak stage to rank two initial stage is a large realm with a sharply different difficulty.",
      "chapters": [
        90
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A Gu Master advances by pouring primeval essence into the aperture walls. Middle stage walls are water barriers, also called water walls or a water membrane,",
      "chapters": [
        33
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "aperture-walls",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "where light flows like water and the wall is thicker than the initial stage light membrane.",
      "chapters": [
        212
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "aperture-walls",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Forming that water wall is the mark of having left initial stage for middle stage.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "aperture-walls",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Green copper primeval essence at rank one middle stage is pale green.",
      "chapters": [
        34
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "primeval-essence-at-this-stage",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "It is more condensed than initial stage jade green essence.",
      "chapters": [
        80
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "primeval-essence-at-this-stage",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Used to nurture the aperture, it works at least twice as efficiently as initial stage essence, and a moonblade thrown with it is far stronger than one powered by initial stage essence of the same rank.",
      "chapters": [
        34
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "primeval-essence-at-this-stage",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A Liquor worm can refine rank one initial stage essence into that middle stage product, so a Gu Master may hold middle stage essence while still cultivating at initial stage.",
      "chapters": [
        34
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "primeval-essence-at-this-stage",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_liquor_worm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Relic Gu of the matching tier can instead raise cultivation itself by one small realm, for example from middle stage to upper stage. Small realm breaks are treated as a matter of effort and time; large realm breaks need aptitude.",
      "chapters": [
        217
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "primeval-essence-at-this-stage",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_relic_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Red steel primeval essence is scarlet at rank two middle stage.",
      "chapters": [
        145
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-two-colour",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_red_steel_primeval_essence"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "White silver essence at rank three middle stage is blossom silver, with varying amounts of silver in the colour.",
      "chapters": [
        312
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-three-colour",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_white_silver_primeval_essence"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A rank four nine eyes liquor worm can purify yellow gold essence by one small realm, yielding yellow gold middle stage essence from a rank four initial stage store.",
      "chapters": [
        326
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-four-colour",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Purple crystal essence at rank five middle stage is violet purple.",
      "chapters": [
        379
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-five-colour",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_purple_crystal_primeval_essence"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Initial Stage, Upper Stage, and Peak Stage complete the set. The full rank ladder is on Ranks and Realms. Essence by rank is on Primeval Essence.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "rank-five-colour",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
